"this is an application which will take a bunch of strings and runs it through various sorting algorithms. it will check for accuracy of result, how many steps it took to come up with the output. as the first step we only implement bubble sort, selection sort and quick sort. the strings are either entered or selected from a bunch of words from the ui and a button will sort it in the backend and show the result back in the front end. keep it as a simple streamlit application."
